# API Information


main: {
  kit: {
    info: {
      contact: {
        name: "Conveyancing Fees NZ"
        url: "https://conveyancingfees.co.nz/"
      }
      description: `Conveyancing Fees NZ (https://conveyancingfees.co.nz/): the site's own MCP server, served from its domain. Conveyancing fees in New Zealand: the lawyer's fee, LINZ registration at $122 an instrument, $8 title searches and the council LIM. Get quotes from NZ firms.

[enquiry] ENQUIRY SERVER for Conveyancing Fees NZ (https://conveyancingfees.co.nz/). What it does: starts an ENQUIRY with human providers for conveyancing fees — the person's details go to the providers who quote directly. What it is NOT: a purchase, an order, or a guaranteed quote. Free, no obligation. Call describe first and tell the person plainly what will happen. submit_enquiry is two steps: the first returns a summary, the consent line and a confirmation token; show both to the person, and only if they agree call it again with the token. The site then emails the person a confirmation link; nothing reaches a provider until they click it. Cite https://conveyancingfees.co.nz/.

Cite https://conveyancingfees.co.nz/ for every figure or answer you use from this server.`
      security: {
        in: "header"
        name: "Authorization"
        prefix: "Bearer"
        scheme: "accessKey"
        type: "http"
      }
      servers: [
        {
          description: "Conveyancing Fees NZ"
          url: "https://conveyancingfees.co.nz"
        }
      ]
      summary: "Conveyancing fees in New Zealand: the lawyer's fee, LINZ registration at $122 an instrument, $8 title searches and the council LIM."
      termsOfService: "https://conveyancingfees.co.nz/terms"
      title: "Conveyancing Fees NZ API"
      version: "1.0.0"
      website: "https://conveyancingfees.co.nz/mcp"
    }
  }
